flowchart LR
    UI[Vue 管理端 / Widget] --> HTTP[fasthttp + fastglue]
    UI <--> WS[WebSocket]
    HTTP --> MW[认证 / 权限 / 限流]
    MW --> H[cmd Handlers]
    H --> M[internal Managers]
    M --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
    M --> R[(Redis)]
    M --> EXT[Email / S3 / OIDC / AI / Webhook]
    WORKER[后台 Worker] --> M
    M --> WS
